{"key":"098e96ef4b9841e25399a2b5c2cf2f93772afdd9e19d1e474794b593fd017cfd","quote":"You told them the thirty-day limit","text":"{\"limits\": [{\"limit\": 30, \"comparison\": \"le\", \"role\": \"constraint\", \"unit\": \"days\"}]}","usage":{"input":622,"output":42}}
