{"key":"073faba718da302cd19aff8af085c2fb358cb4f1e3f5bef59c7bde6e90187758","quote":"If every light is normal and the internet is still slow, run the speed check in the line monitor.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":637,"output":9}}
{"key":"dad7486d423579eb6d6895576f6318e45fa3e059a9f287d5d78ea80fb9401c49","quote":"Book a technician only after the restart and the socket test have failed.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":628,"output":9}}
